	(text "Chip-down radio (rf-layout §0): the match and harmonic filter are ST's IPD for this package (MLPF-WB55-01E3,\n  DS12804: 50 ohm out, IL 0.9 dB, 2fo 40 dB, 3fo 45 dB); its land per DS12804 Fig. 13 (project library, D-016).\n  IN (A3) goes straight to RF1 (pin 21) with the shortest possible track; each GND land gets its own via to L2.\nRF_OUT -> antenna: 50 ohm grounded coplanar line on F.Cu over solid In1.Cu ground, no vias, stubs or test\n  points (rf-layout §2); width/gap from JLCPCB's calculator for JLC04161H-7628 (open item OI-1).\nTuning pi at the feed (rf-layout §3): R501 0 ohm series (fitted), C501/C502 0402 shunts DNP; fit at most two\n  parts after VNA tuning in the enclosure, target SWR <= 2 (NWP-017). C0G parts, 0402 as laid out.\nAE501: TI SWRA117D (AN043) meandered IFA, copper only, at the top board edge; keep-out on all layers, no\n  ground under it (rf-layout §4). AN043 was designed on a different stack-up: retune (D-007, B5).\nNo conducted test port: the parts list has no RF connector (deviation from rf-layout §9, D-007)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e45879da-ff4a-57a7-b46c-c2df0eed520e")
	)
